{
  "bookId": "hero-213003",
  "id": "bond-27507",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "27507001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这么晚了，还不睡吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27507002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "睡不着呢……能不能让妾身咬一口？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27507003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "咬一口？\n……唔！你真咬啊？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27507004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "呼，舒服多了~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27507005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "不过你居然都不挣扎一下，真是无趣呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27507006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "因为我想，你一定是有什么内心烦闷的事才这样的吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27507007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "……其实没什么，就是酒瘾犯了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27507008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "毕竟女人是需要玫瑰和红酒滋养的嘛，变成手办之后，连基本的口腹之欲也无法享受了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27507009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……如果咬我能让你开心一点的话，你就多咬几口吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27507010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "嗯？你该不会是在暗爽吧？我的主人还真是够变态的呢~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27507011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "不过，妾身却一点也不讨厌这样的主人。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27507012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "你刚才说什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27507013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "没听清的话就算了~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
